sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Repo as ReviewRepository
    participant SSOT as Room (Ch 3)
    participant Up as Upload (Ch 17)
    participant Out as Outbox (Ch 31)
    participant Srv as Server (moderate/rank/aggregate, Ch 73)

    User->>Repo: submit 5 stars, text, 2 photos
    Repo->>SSOT: insert clientId, status Posting (optimistic, Ch 72)
    Repo->>Up: upload photos -> media ids (Ch 17)
    Repo->>Out: enqueue SubmitReview clientId as idempotency key (Ch 15/31)
    Out->>Srv: submit review authed + eligible (Ch 23)
    Srv->>Srv: moderate + persist + update aggregates/ranking
    Srv-->>Out: Posted or PendingModeration (+ serverId)
    Out->>SSOT: status + serverId (reconcile)
    Note over Out,Srv: offline/death -> outbox retries. idempotency dedups
